  "title": "T22",
  "description": "EEG dataset (TX22) from a simulated, semi-automated driving experiment using a leader-follower paradigm. It examines trust-based decisions about handing off and taking over control authority. The study tests whether real-time predictions of when intervention is needed can be used to give the driver feedback that supports active trust management. It builds on an earlier experiment (ARL_TX20) that used the same paradigm.",
  "methods_description": "Participants performed simulated semi-automated driving in a leader-follower paradigm, deciding when to hand off or take over control authority. The design reused the paradigm from the earlier ARL_TX20 experiment. Predictions of when intervention was needed were used to provide feedback to the driver.",
